  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">black mussels sizzle in a pot with golden olive oil, garlic, shallot, and bright lemon, plus a touch of tomato paste and a splash of savory seafood stock. As the steam rises, the shells open to reveal tender, briny sweetness that begs for crusty bread. A playful pinch of chili flakes and a hint of fresh fennel bring gentle warmth, while parsley adds a burst of garden freshness. Quick, simple, and irresistible, black mussels deliver breezy seaside charm at your table, no passport required.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Black Mussel</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-black-mussels\">Why You’ll Love This black mussels</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-black-mussels\">How to Make Black Mussels</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-black-mussels\">Pro Tips for Making black mussels</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-black-mussels\">How to Serve this black mussels</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-black-mussels\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This black mussels</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>They&#8217;re packed with protein and low in calories.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cooking them is quick and easy, perfect for busy nights.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They absorb flavors beautifully, making every bite a delight.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rich in essential nutrients like omega-3 fatty acids.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They&#8217;re a sustainable seafood choice, good for you and the planet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-6344\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"6344\" data-servings=\"4\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"533\" height=\"300\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"A bowl of black mussels in broth with parsley and crusty bread on the side.\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth.webp 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth-768x432.webp 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Delicious-Black-Mussels-in-Garlic-Broth-480x270.webp 480w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 533px) 100vw, 533px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">black mussels</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Discover the art of cooking black mussels with our delicious guide! 🐚✨ Easy tips and recipes for a mouthwatering seafood